/*
  DrivingPerformanceCards.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0055 · DrivingPerformanceCards (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `DrivingPerformanceCards` resolves (table "DrivingPerformanceCards") lives here with its
  web English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog
  at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt
  owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group holds the keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/analytics/components/analytics/DrivingPerformanceCards.tsx) — the canonical
  `analytics.driving.*` namespace. The remaining keys back the native-only chrome
  (freshness chip, stale/offline banner, loading + error + retry copy, empty hint).
*/

